# =============================================================================
# reelbox-cli .gitignore
#
# What's tracked: the CLI source (src/), its build config (package.json,
# tsconfig.json), pnpm-workspace.yaml, and pnpm-lock.yaml (reproducible
# installs). Everything below is either a build artifact regenerated by
# `pnpm build`, a local dependency cache, machine/editor noise, or local
# state dropped by the ruflo/agentic-qe/Claude Code tooling used during
# development sessions in this repo -- none of it is CLI source.
# =============================================================================

# --- Node.js (pnpm) -----------------------------------------------------------
# Installed via `pnpm install`; pnpm-lock.yaml IS tracked (it's what makes
# installs reproducible), only the installed packages and npm/pnpm's own
# logs are ignored.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- TypeScript build output ---------------------------------------------------
# `pnpm build` (tsc) emits dist/ per tsconfig.json's outDir -- regenerated
# from src/ on every build, not hand-authored.
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Test coverage ---------------------------------------------------------------
# `pnpm test:coverage` (vitest --coverage) writes an HTML/JSON/lcov report
# here -- regenerated on every run, not hand-authored.
coverage/

# --- npm pack output ---------------------------------------------------------------
# `npm pack` / `npm pack --dry-run` writes a tarball to the CWD when not
# given --dry-run's implicit suppression; belt-and-suspenders in case one
# ever gets left behind (e.g. RELEASING.md's verification steps).
*.tgz

# --- Secrets / local environment -----------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# --- OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Editors / IDEs ---------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Claude Code local config ------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.local.md

# --- Codex local configuration -------------------------------------------------
.codex/

# --- ruflo / agentic-kit / Claude Code local tooling state ---------------------
# Machine-local runtime data from the ruflo/agentic-kit/agentic-qe tooling used
# during development sessions in this repo -- generic skill/command packs
# dropped by Claude Code plugins (ruflo, agentic-qe, superpowers), MCP server
# registration, swarm/session memory DBs, and AgentDB vector stores. None of
# it is reelbox source; it's regenerated per-machine by the `ruflo`/`ak`/`aqe`
# tooling, never checked in. .agentic-qe/ in particular can contain
# witness-keys/ with real private key material (*.key.pem), which is why
# *.pem and *.key are also ignored here as defense-in-depth in case key
# material ever lands somewhere unexpected.
.claude/
.agentic-qe/
.claude-flow/
.agents/
.swarm/
.mcp.json
.ruflo/
.ruvector/
ruvector.db
agentdb.rvf*
skills-lock.json
*.pem
*.key
